 =20
   =20
   =20
 =20

<p>Use <code translate=3D"no" dir=3D"ltr">generateContent</code> or <code t=
ranslate=3D"no" dir=3D"ltr">streamGenerateContent</code> to generate conten=
t with
Gemini.</p>

<p>The Gemini model family includes models that work with multimodal
prompt requests. The term multimodal indicates that you can use more than o=
ne
modality, or type of input, in a prompt. Models that aren't multimodal acce=
pt
prompts only with text. Modalities can include text, audio, video, and more=
.</p>

<h2 id=3D"get-started" data-text=3D"Create a Google Cloud account to get st=
arted" tabindex=3D"-1" role=3D"presentation"><span class=3D"devsite-heading=
" role=3D"heading" aria-level=3D"2">Create a Google Cloud account to get st=
arted</span><button type=3D"button" class=3D"devsite-heading-link button-fl=
at material-icons" aria-label=3D"Copy link to this section: Create a Google=
 Cloud account to get started" data-title=3D"Copy link to this section: Cre=
ate a Google Cloud account to get started" data-id=3D"get-started"></button=
></h2>

<p>To start using the Vertex AI API for Gemini, <a href=3D"https://console.=
cloud.google.com/freetrial?redirectPath=3D/marketplace/product/google/cloud=
aicompanion.googleapis.com">create a Google Cloud account</a>.</p>

<p>After creating your account, use this document to review the Gemini mode=
l <a href=3D"https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/model-re=
ference/inference#request">request body</a>, <a href=3D"https://cloud.googl=
e.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/model-reference/inference#parameters">mo=
del parameters</a>, <a href=3D"https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generativ=
e-ai/docs/model-reference/inference#response">response body</a>, and some s=
ample <a href=3D"https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/mode=
l-reference/inference#sample-requests">requests</a>.</p>

<p>When you're ready, see the
<a href=3D"https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/start/quic=
kstarts/quickstart-multimodal">Vertex AI API for Gemini quickstart</a>
to learn how to send a request to the Vertex AI Gemini API using a programm=
ing language SDK or the REST API.</p>

